Tests/StoicAttestationTests/Vectors/apple-development.json holds App Attest
attestations and assertions captured from iPhones (iOS 14.2 to 14.4, the
development environment) by Vincent Haupert, taken from the test resources of
devicecheck-appattest (https://github.com/veehaitch/devicecheck-appattest,
src/test/resources/ios-*.yaml, commit cb26211f63c1e2e7949deafe2efdf352daca27fa),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The values were copied
unchanged into another file format.

Sources/StoicAttestation/AppAttestTypes.swift embeds the Apple App Attestation
Root CA certificate, as Apple publishes it at
https://www.apple.com/certificateauthority/.
